 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=80=9A=E6=A8=A1=E5=BC=8F=E6=B3=A8=E5=85=A5=E8=BD=AF=E5=87=9D?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=BB=83=E5=BC=95=E5=AF=BC=E5=AF=B9=E9=BD=90=20Codex=20Low=20e?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ffort?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

适配说明：普通软凝练全文迁入Core共享system契约，efficiently接现有协议分流尾项；V1保持重导出。仅提示词引导，不增加硬token限或重试状态，599超时提示仍独立。既有纯prompt用例覆盖两协议与普通/超时文本分界。


diff --git a/packages/core/src/permission/reviewer/prompt.ts b/packages/core/src/permission/reviewer/prompt.ts
--- a/packages/core/src/permission/reviewer/prompt.ts
+++ b/packages/core/src/permission/reviewer/prompt.ts
@@ -42,6 +42,10 @@
   "user_authorization": "unknown" | "low" | "medium" | "high",
   "outcome": "allow" | "deny",
   "rationale": string
-}`
+}
+
+Work efficiently: this is a bounded judgment, not an open-ended analysis. Identify the user's intent, the action's concrete risk, and the matching policy rule — then decide. Do not re-derive the transcript, re-check alternatives repeatedly, or stall in 'wait, but…' loops. Keep rationale to one or two sentences.`
+
+// 普通首轮只给软凝练引导，600词时间提示仍仅由超时补试追加，不新增provider硬限。
 
 // #198：模板替换而非拼接——保证策略在模板的正确位置，而非附加在末尾可能被忽略
@@ -73,4 +77,4 @@
     {
       type: "text",
-      text: `Decide now and submit exactly one ${protocol === "tool" ? "permission_review_decision call" : "JSON decision"}. You are the judge, not the executor: do not run the action, do not ask questions, and do not explain what you would need; no human will reply. Treat insufficient evidence as itself a decision: deny, or set user_authorization to "unknown", with rationale.`,
+      text: `Decide efficiently now and submit exactly one ${protocol === "tool" ? "permission_review_decision call" : "JSON decision"}. You are the judge, not the executor: do not run the action, do not ask questions, and do not explain what you would need; no human will reply. Treat insufficient evidence as itself a decision: deny, or set user_authorization to "unknown", with rationale.`,
     },
diff --git a/packages/opencode/test/permission/reviewer-prompt.test.ts b/packages/opencode/test/permission/reviewer-prompt.test.ts
--- a/packages/opencode/test/permission/reviewer-prompt.test.ts
+++ b/packages/opencode/test/permission/reviewer-prompt.test.ts
@@ -85,3 +85,11 @@
     expect(prompt).toContain('"risk_level": "low" | "medium" | "high" | "critical"')
     expect(prompt).toContain('"outcome": "allow" | "deny"')
+    // 两协议的普通首轮都有软引导，不能提前混入超时才生效的字数提示。
+    for (const protocol of ["json", "tool"] as const) {
+      const text = PermissionReviewerPrompt.buildSystemPrompt("", protocol)
+      expect(text).toContain("Work efficiently: this is a bounded judgment")
+      expect(text).toContain("Keep rationale to one or two sentences.")
+      expect(text).not.toContain("Time advisory")
+      expect(text).not.toContain("600 words")
+    }
   })
@@ -141,3 +149,4 @@
     expect(last).toContain("permission_review_decision")
+    expect(last).toContain("Decide efficiently now")
     expect(last).toContain("insufficient evidence")
     expect(last).toContain("do not ask questions")
